  "sourceTitle": "Pork Patties",
  "sourceText": "Pork Patties\nBy: Pearl\nPublished: Saturday, February 13, 2010 - 4:28am\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n1 pound Ground Pork -- lean\n1 teaspoon Salt\n1 teaspoon Dried Sage\n1 teaspoon Ground Nutmeg\n1 teaspoon Pepper\n1 teaspoon Dried Thyme\n1 teaspoon Ground Ginger\n2 tablespoons Water\n\nPreparation\n\n1 In a bowl combine all ingredients; mix well.  2 Shape into six patties.  3 Fry in a skillet until meat is browned and cooked throughout.",
